+/*
+ * x1s (iOS 27 kernel): what Jesvi's display stand-ins (iokit/Kernel/MiniIOMobileFramebuffer.cpp, MiniIOSurface.cpp)
+ * call in the rest of his G981B kernel, reduced to what this kernel needs: logging goes to the kernel log, the clock
+ * governor and camera DMA are absent, the GICv3 attach fails (GICv2 here), the calibration SPI and GPIO do nothing.
+ */
